                <h2 id="agents-title" class="h2" data-reveal>Run five agents without becoming the switchboard.</h2>
              </div>
              <p class="body head__aside" data-reveal>
                Astrolabe drives the coding agents on your computer: Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Grok,
                OpenCode and Antigravity. Your code goes to the provider you chose, as when you run its
                command line yourself.
              </p>
            </div>
            <ol class="pcards">
              <li class="pcard" tabindex="0">
